  "layout_decision": "Connectivity-first: the external Gateway sits outside the VPC; the regional proxy-only subnet provides the Gateway-to-backend path. Storefront and Order are horizontal; Catalog and Payment mock are stacked vertically for short two-way fan-out from Order. The telemetry collector is below the app namespace; Cloud Trace/Logging are project-level services outside the VPC. Build/image delivery is a separate bottom lane.",
